    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In short:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A minimalistic but challenging blend of RTS, Tower Defence, and Survivors-like<br></li><li>No nonsense action-packed high-tension gameplay<br></li><li>Rebuild a kingdom city-by-city in a company with hand crafted levels and 4+ hours of gameplay<br></li><li>Quick levels of up to 45 minutes<br></li><li>Simple meta progression<br></li><li>Slay hordes of monsters<br></li><li>Rebuild your city and defend it with your hero, troops and towers<br></li><li>Become stronger and upgrade your hero to unlock new overpowered abilities<br></li><li>Heroic difficulty with larger and stronger hordes for those brave enough</li></ul>",
